# Files excluded from the published package.
#
# NOTE: when this file exists, pub uses it INSTEAD of .gitignore to decide what
# to publish. Everything .gitignore excludes therefore has to be repeated here,
# or it would end up in the archive.

# --- Internal, not for pub.dev -------------------------------------------
# The pre-release audit and the task brief it was written from. Both describe
# work in progress and are for contributors, not consumers. doc/MIGRATION.md is
# deliberately NOT listed: that one ships.
AUDIT.md
TASK.md
folder_structure.md

# --- Mirrors .gitignore --------------------------------------------------
# Miscellaneous
*.class
*.log
*.pyc
*.swp
.DS_Store
.atom/
.buildlog/
.history
.svn/
migrate_working_dir/

# IntelliJ related
*.iml
*.ipr
*.iws
.idea/

# Flutter/Dart/Pub related
# Libraries should not include pubspec.lock, per https://dart.dev/guides/libraries/private-files#pubspeclock.
/pubspec.lock
**/doc/api/
.dart_tool/
.flutter-plugins
.flutter-plugins-dependencies
build/
